WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.830
This is eighty gigabytes. And it's not getting uploaded anywhere.

2
00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:08.200
Share a six-character code, and it goes straight from your disk to theirs.

3
00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:13.390
Sixty-two percent in, you have to go.

4
00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:17.400
That's fine. Next morning, it picks up right where it stopped.

5
00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:21.760
Nothing stored in between. Nothing to sign up for.
